01:26:23.290 --> 01:26:25.290
Philippians chapter 3.

287
01:26:28.290 --> 01:26:29.290
Hallelujah.

288
01:26:29.290 --> 01:26:34.290
Lord, bless us as a congregation that we may grow.

289
