294
01:26:49.290 --> 01:26:52.290
Long converted or just newly converted.

295
01:26:52.290 --> 01:26:56.290
I pray that we all may grow through the Word of God.

296
01:26:56.290 --> 01:27:01.290
The Bible says, faith comes by hearing the Word.

297
01:27:01.290 --> 01:27:04.290
Not just by encouraging each other.

298
01:27:04.290 --> 01:27:06.290
Hey cool, do I have to come to church here?

299
