301
01:27:13.290 --> 01:27:16.290
And that is through the Bible, through God's Word.

302
01:27:16.290 --> 01:27:18.290
When you come to church.

303
01:27:18.290 --> 01:27:20.290
And if you come to church for a while.

304
01:27:20.290 --> 01:27:23.290
And the first step of coming to an open church would be.

305
01:27:23.290 --> 01:27:26.290
Yes, okay, I see that those people are somewhat enthusiastic.

306
01:27:26.290 --> 01:27:30.290
I want to come more often or I need to clear things up in my life.

