423
01:33:28.290 --> 01:33:30.290
And when Joop and I walk together...

424
01:33:30.290 --> 01:33:33.290
and we talk about health, for example...

425
01:33:33.290 --> 01:33:37.290
and he also helps people in that area...

426
01:33:37.290 --> 01:33:40.290
then Joop can tell me...

427
01:33:40.290 --> 01:33:45.290
it's quite alright to have a nice ice cream every now and then.

428
01:33:45.290 --> 01:33:47.290
That's perfectly fine.

429
01:33:47.290 --> 01:33:50.290
And the same applies here, you have to be careful...

430
01:33:50.290 --> 01:33:52.290
