454
01:34:59.290 --> 01:35:02.290
Do you understand my philosophy so far?

455
01:35:02.290 --> 01:35:04.290
The same way.

456
01:35:04.290 --> 01:35:07.290
So if you say in that health context...

457
01:35:07.290 --> 01:35:10.290
hey listen, I actually need to lose 20 kilos...

458
01:35:10.290 --> 01:35:11.290
how am I going to do that?

459
01:35:11.290 --> 01:35:14.290
You especially don't do that by sticking to the cake.

460
01:35:14.290 --> 01:35:17.290
You especially do that by eating less in carbohydrates...

461
01:35:17.290 --> 01:35:20.290
and so on and so forth and blah blah blah.

462
01:35:20.290 --> 01:35:22.290
So then you especially don't say...

463
01:35:22.290 --> 01:35:26.290
hey listen, I'm just going to be able to enjoy eating here.

464
01:35:26.290 --> 01:35:33.290
What do you need to be in Christ...

465
01:35:33.290 --> 01:35:35.290
and now we are going to the Bible...

466
01:35:35.290 --> 01:35:37.290
to be in Christ...

467
01:35:37.290 --> 01:35:42.290
what do you need that I would speak to you from a podium?

468
01:35:42.290 --> 01:35:45.290
Do you need me to tell you...

469
01:35:45.290 --> 01:35:48.290
brother, sister, son or daughter of God...

470
01:35:48.290 --> 01:35:54.290
you may rest in the assurance that King Jesus loves you...

471
01:35:54.290 --> 01:35:56.290
