472
01:35:56.290 --> 01:36:00.290
and that you don't have to try your best to the point of exhaustion...

473
01:36:00.290 --> 01:36:03.290
to just come into that love of Jesus...

474
01:36:03.290 --> 01:36:06.290
do you perhaps need me to tell you...

475
01:36:06.290 --> 01:36:09.290
He loves you. He loves you.

476
01:36:09.290 --> 01:36:13.290
You don't have to try so ridiculously hard...

477
01:36:13.290 --> 01:36:15.290
to just have to try your best.

478
01:36:15.290 --> 01:36:18.290
To just have to try your best.

479
01:36:18.290 --> 01:36:22.290
Some here in the audience need...

480
01:36:22.290 --> 01:36:25.290
that you receive a warning at the right time...

481
01:36:25.290 --> 01:36:28.290
that you hear at the right time...

482
01:36:28.290 --> 01:36:32.290
friend, girlfriend, son, daughter of God, brother, sister...

483
01:36:32.290 --> 01:36:35.290
what you must do, you need to stop doing that.

484
01:36:35.290 --> 01:36:38.290
For this lifestyle you are currently engaged in...

485
01:36:38.290 --> 01:36:42.290
will ultimately lead you to death without Jesus.

486
01:36:42.290 --> 01:36:45.290
And some of you here in the audience need a warning...

487
01:36:45.290 --> 01:36:49.290
and some of you here in the audience need encouragement.

488
01:36:49.290 --> 01:36:53.290
And this is what Paul is laying out here in Philippians chapter 3...

489
01:36:53.290 --> 01:36:55.290
in contrast to each other.

490
01:36:55.290 --> 01:36:57.290
And it is difficult for the church.

491
01:36:57.290 --> 01:37:02.290
It is quite difficult for the church to always have the right dosage...

492
01:37:02.290 --> 01:37:06.290
to encourage the people, to have to warn the people...

493
01:37:06.290 --> 01:37:08.290
to have to give the people discipline.

494
01:37:08.290 --> 01:37:12.290
A Dutch word, it is quite difficult as a pastor of a church...

495
01:37:12.290 --> 01:37:16.290
to bring the church under a piece of, here comes the word, discipline.

496
01:37:16.290 --> 01:37:20.290
When you see all kinds of things happening in the church that make you think...

497
01:37:20.290 --> 01:37:24.290
no, this is not good, this way the people will be lost.

498
01:37:24.290 --> 01:37:27.290
Then as a pastor you have to jump on a stage, you have to say...

499
01:37:27.290 --> 01:37:31.290
